dev-wallpaper
=============

Setup (per user, no sudo needed):
    dev-wallpaper-setup                 interactive questions
    dev-wallpaper-setup --animated no --interval 60
    dev-wallpaper-setup --animated yes --interval 15 --speed 2 --themes dracula,nord --languages php,laravel
    dev-wallpaper-setup --themes light  only the light themes (or: dark)

Other commands:
    dev-wallpaper-setup --now       new design right away
    dev-wallpaper-setup --status    current settings and next change
    dev-wallpaper-setup --disable   stop and restore the previous wallpaper
    dev-wallpaper --list            available themes and languages

Settings live in ~/.config/dev-wallpaper/config. Images go to ~/.local/share/dev-wallpaper.
Animation steps are whole seconds because GNOME Shell updates slideshow backgrounds at most once per second.
